# ── Local audio inputs ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copyrighted source recordings live here for local testing only.
# Never commit them — beautifulyze reads audio from any path you pass it.
/audio/

# ── Generated renders at the repo root ────────────────────────────
# Ad-hoc renders land beside the audio you point the tool at; the
# curated showcase lives in examples/ and IS tracked.
/*.png
/*.json

